<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 147 AND 19-0, SRI LANKA 222 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 147 AND 19-0, SRI LANKA 222 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, 75 behind on first innings, were 19-0 in their second innings at the close of the second day of the second test against Sri Lanka at Arnos Vale on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 19-0, Sri Lanka 222</p>
